# "Whenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player": on turn 3 Bot1's equipped Ornithopter (2/4 flying, trample)
# is blocked by Bot2's Ornithopter and deals its damage to that creature (which dies), and an unequipped Mother of Runes hits Bot2: no
# trigger for either, no Treasure and no question. On turn 5 the equipped Ornithopter, now unblocked, hits Bot2 and
# makes a Treasure (the positive control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Sol Ring
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Orcrist, Goblin-cleaver
Ornithopter
Mother of Runes
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Island x15

